  "name": "Authress",
  "abstract": "Hosted login and access control API from Rhosys AG, in Switzerland. It combines a hosted login box (social, passwordless, passkeys, MFA and per-tenant enterprise SSO) with fine-grained, resource-based authorization built on roles, permissions and access records. It also covers service clients and API keys, EdDSA-signed JWTs, an audit trail and a Terraform provider. Pricing is pay-per-call with no seat or MAU minimum, and an open-source local test instance is available for development.",
